{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"jsonnet","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Jsonnet","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Jsonnet (.jsonnet .libsonnet).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"jsonnet","name":"Jsonnet","extensions":[".jsonnet",".libsonnet"],"grammar":"grammars/jsonnet.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Jsonnet","path":"snippets/jsonnet.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/jsonnet.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\|\\\\|\\\\|\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\|\\\\|\\\\|\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$|::?:?\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*(?=\\\\s*(?:\\\\([^)]*\\\\))?\\\\s*::?:?)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:tailstrict|importstr|importbin|function|assert|import|error|false|local|super|else|null|then|self|true|for|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|super|true|null|self)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:std\\\\.objectFields|std\\\\.manifestJson|std\\\\.toString|std\\\\.length|std\\\\.filter|std\\\\.format|std\\\\.join|std\\\\.map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/jsonnet.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Local\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"local\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"local ${1:name} = ${2:value};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A local variable\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"local ${1:name}(${2:x}) = ${3:x};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Object\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"obj\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{\",\n      \"  ${1:field}: ${2:value},\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An object\"\n  },\n  \"Import\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"imp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"local ${1:lib} = import '${2:lib.libsonnet}';\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"import\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Jsonnet\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Jsonnet.\n\n## Files\n\n`.jsonnet`, `.libsonnet`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `local` | A local variable |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `obj` | An object |\n| `imp` | import |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}